01:03:27,320 --> 01:03:27,520
It's fine.

1078
01:03:28,740 --> 01:03:29,440
Go straight.

1079
01:03:32,280 --> 01:03:32,680
Here.

1080
01:03:32,960 --> 01:03:33,320
There.

1081
01:03:36,060 --> 01:03:37,580
Of course, we have trees everywhere.

1082
01:03:49,550 --> 01:03:51,230
I can't wait to check on the Orphan Crusher.

1083
01:03:51,530 --> 01:03:52,610
I'm already excited.

1084
01:03:53,310 --> 01:03:54,730
Hopefully I'm not out of range right now.

1085
01:03:54,830 --> 01:03:55,670
How far away am I?

1086
01:03:59,010 --> 01:03:59,790
There's no way.

1087
01:04:00,010 --> 01:04:00,670
There's no way.

1088
01:04:01,510 --> 01:04:02,870
I'm definitely in range.

1089
01:04:10,460 --> 01:04:12,120
Okay, get rid of that.

1090
01:04:13,320 --> 01:04:16,620
Let's not make it too... Okay, so when does it end?

1091
01:04:17,180 --> 01:04:17,860
Right there.

1092
01:04:19,040 --> 01:04:19,860
Okay, okay, okay.

1093
01:04:20,400 --> 01:04:22,560
See, here it goes down a bit too much, doesn't it?

1094
01:04:24,220 --> 01:04:25,520
That is an issue.

1095
01:04:25,760 --> 01:04:26,000
Ooh!

1096
01:04:27,900 --> 01:04:29,500
I just had an idea.

1097
01:04:31,520 --> 01:04:32,920
How about this look?

1098
01:04:33,040 --> 01:04:33,580
Check this out.

1099
01:04:39,780 --> 01:04:40,800
Is that crazy?

1100
01:04:44,500 --> 01:04:47,840
We keep the same height everywhere and then, you know what I mean?

1101
01:04:49,380 --> 01:04:49,860
Hmm.

1102
01:04:52,280 --> 01:04:53,200
Let me get a feeling.

1103
01:04:57,520 --> 01:04:58,640
Maybe it's too tall.

1104
01:05:00,040 --> 01:05:01,620
Feels a little crazy, doesn't it?

1105
01:05:03,900 --> 01:05:05,100
Yeah, I don't know about that.

1106
01:05:05,900 --> 01:05:07,000
It's gonna look inconsistent.

1107
01:05:16,680 --> 01:05:18,020
I'll just add a little bit of dirt.

1108
01:05:19,700 --> 01:05:20,240
It's okay.

1109
01:05:26,160 --> 01:05:27,320
So here we go like that.

1110
01:05:28,840 --> 01:05:29,200
Yeah.

1111
01:05:30,880 --> 01:05:31,600
Yeah, that's fine.

1112
01:05:31,720 --> 01:05:32,300
That's fine, actually.

1113
01:05:37,340 --> 01:05:38,500
We're gonna have to grab some dirt.

1114
01:05:39,300 --> 01:05:40,040
Let's steal some.

1115
01:05:51,860 --> 01:05:54,080
Oh man, I had such good tools before I died.

1116
01:05:54,960 --> 01:05:57,980
I could practically brrrr anything in the world that I wanted to.

1117
01:05:59,820 --> 01:06:04,540
But now I'm limited to b-b-b-b-b instead of brrrr.

1118
01:06:05,020 --> 01:06:06,720
And boy, it feels bad.

1119
01:06:16,890 --> 01:06:18,810
So how far do I need to go with this?

1120
01:06:20,330 --> 01:06:21,710
Let's just get a count here.

1121
01:06:22,530 --> 01:06:23,570
So this is the edge.

1122
01:06:25,190 --> 01:06:26,110
Like here.

1123
01:06:29,730 --> 01:06:37,690
And my wall is... There.

1124
01:06:37,930 --> 01:06:38,370
Right here.

1125
01:06:39,670 --> 01:06:41,630
Let's just put down this to remember.

1126
01:06:46,500 --> 01:06:50,620
I mean, the village is going to have a bit of a rectangular shape with the wall, but that's fine.

1127
01:06:51,600 --> 01:06:52,680
We're going to expand that later.

1128
01:06:53,460 --> 01:06:53,720
Again.

1129
01:07:03,900 --> 01:07:07,980
I really just want to get a functional village going, you know, where nobody is dying or escaping.

1130
01:07:09,840 --> 01:07:12,620
And have enough houses for everyone so nobody sleeps in the rain.

1131
01:07:14,260 --> 01:07:15,400
Level up the people.

1132
01:07:17,020 --> 01:07:18,280
Get some trading going.

1133
01:07:18,820 --> 01:07:20,360
You know, like a healthy community.

1134
01:07:24,460 --> 01:07:25,220
That's my dream.

1135
01:07:33,760 --> 01:07:34,480
Okay.

1136
01:07:42,760 --> 01:07:44,900
So here we go up here.

1137
01:07:51,680 --> 01:07:52,400
Nice.

1138
01:07:52,820 --> 01:07:54,180
I aligned it perfectly as well.

1139
01:07:58,880 --> 01:07:59,820
Not bad.

1140
01:08:00,400 --> 01:08:01,580
Not bad at all.

1141
01:08:07,690 --> 01:08:09,090
Let's continue the wall from over here.

1142
01:08:09,350 --> 01:08:11,590
Also, I can get more material by removing this wall.

1143
01:08:13,350 --> 01:08:15,390
Because that one is not going to be needed.

1144
01:08:17,810 --> 01:08:21,650
By the way, I was thinking we could have walls like this inside the village too, along paths.

1145
01:08:22,470 --> 01:08:24,830
You know, I'm thinking the UK.

1146
01:08:25,490 --> 01:08:34,390
Out in the country, they always have these sort of brick... Or not brick, it's more like stone walls along the roads they have, where they drive.

1147
01:08:34,550 --> 01:08:34,910
Do you know what I mean?

1148
01:08:36,160 --> 01:08:38,500
Maybe something like that could be really neat.

1149
01:08:46,540 --> 01:08:47,740
This tree is annoying me.

1150
01:09:02,100 --> 01:09:02,640
Oh god.

1151
01:09:02,840 --> 01:09:03,360
You know what?

1152
01:09:03,360 --> 01:09:04,140
I'm gonna go get some shears.

1153
01:09:05,200 --> 01:09:06,040
It's shearing time.

1154
01:09:07,720 --> 01:09:09,100
You can call me Ed Shearin.

1155
01:09:11,440 --> 01:09:14,400
I have actually not listened to any of his songs.

1156
01:09:14,460 --> 01:09:15,320
I just know he's a singer.

1157
01:09:16,740 --> 01:09:18,500
I couldn't tell you what any of his songs are.

1158
01:09:18,620 --> 01:09:23,260
Maybe if I heard them I would recognize, but... Farming in?

1159
01:09:26,500 --> 01:09:26,880
Mushrooms.

1160
01:09:28,840 --> 01:09:29,560
I don't know.

1161
01:09:30,200 --> 01:09:31,140
Did I put them in here?

1162
01:09:31,360 --> 01:09:31,780
I did.

1163
01:09:31,960 --> 01:09:32,420
Okay, good.

1164
01:09:34,160 --> 01:09:35,660
I have a lot of wood on me.

1165
01:09:35,760 --> 01:09:36,320
Actually, lovely.

1166
01:09:38,520 --> 01:09:39,760
Sand, we don't need that anymore.

1167
01:09:42,480 --> 01:09:44,300
Okay, bucket can go back in here.

1168
01:09:45,040 --> 01:09:45,400
Sticks.

1169
01:09:45,920 --> 01:09:47,820
I guess I got those from the trees.

1170
01:09:49,460 --> 01:09:50,540
Not that many, honestly.

1171
01:09:52,420 --> 01:09:53,460
You should sleep as well.

1172
01:09:54,860 --> 01:09:55,860
Why did I come back here?

1173
01:09:57,880 --> 01:09:59,340
Oh, shears, right.

1174
01:10:00,300 --> 01:10:02,420
It's shearin'.

1175
01:10:02,420 --> 01:10:03,560
Shears, shears.

1176
01:10:04,280 --> 01:10:05,540
I may not have any.

1177
01:10:05,880 --> 01:10:06,600
Oh, I do.

1178
01:10:06,780 --> 01:10:07,160
Nice.

1179
01:10:08,500 --> 01:10:09,360
Fuck yeah.

1180
01:10:12,100 --> 01:10:13,380
Uh, who are you?

1181
01:10:14,960 --> 01:10:16,040
Aw, man.

1182
01:10:17,740 --> 01:10:18,900
Is the other guy dead?

1183
01:10:19,860 --> 01:10:21,320
Forget his name now, actually.

1184
01:10:25,520 --> 01:10:26,660
I need to clean this up too.

1185
01:10:26,860 --> 01:10:27,280
It's ugly.

1186
01:10:35,520 --> 01:10:36,000
Let's sleep.

1187
01:10:41,400 --> 01:10:44,400
Okay, how much am I gonna pick up from the Orphan Crusher next time I go there?

1188
01:10:44,600 --> 01:10:47,640
I'm not gonna reveal when I'm going there, but how much?

1189
01:10:48,020 --> 01:10:50,580
How many blast powders am I gonna get?

1190
01:10:52,820 --> 01:10:55,940
I'm gonna say... 20.

1191
01:10:57,660 --> 01:10:58,960
Wait, that's a big drop here.

1192
01:10:59,060 --> 01:11:00,160
This is actually kind of catastrophic.

1193
01:11:04,060 --> 01:11:06,080
That, no, that, that's bad.

1194
01:11:06,720 --> 01:11:09,400
Nope, we're gonna adjust a little bit here.

1195
01:11:11,960 --> 01:11:12,900
We can't have that.

1196
01:11:17,740 --> 01:11:19,180
Modify the terrain, nobody will know.

1197
01:11:20,600 --> 01:11:22,260
Boom, looks totally natural, doesn't it?

1198
01:11:34,580 --> 01:11:35,760
Oh no, I ran out!

1199
01:11:35,940 --> 01:11:36,360
Fuck!

1200
01:11:36,560 --> 01:11:37,020
It's fine.

1201
01:11:41,000 --> 01:11:41,960
Tell me I have more.

1202
01:11:42,580 --> 01:11:44,600
Oh no, where did I put the box?

1203
01:11:47,280 --> 01:11:47,760
Schulker!

1204
01:11:49,220 --> 01:11:50,220
Where are you?

1205
01:11:54,280 --> 01:11:55,060
There you are.

1206
01:11:58,780 --> 01:12:00,400
Okay, I got some stone brick.

1207
01:12:00,640 --> 01:12:00,820
Wait.

1208
01:12:04,760 --> 01:12:05,800
Spider.

1209
01:12:14,490 --> 01:12:16,310
Why are you drunk with that effect again?

1210
01:12:16,890 --> 01:12:18,130
It has some kind of effect on.

1211
01:12:18,270 --> 01:12:18,510
Look.

1212
01:12:21,230 --> 01:12:22,710
What is going on with the spiders here?

1213
01:12:24,010 --> 01:12:24,370
Huh?

1214
01:12:26,170 --> 01:12:26,830
Okay, you know what?

1215
01:12:26,890 --> 01:12:28,950
Not being able to shoot through the wall is actually really annoying.

1216
01:12:29,950 --> 01:12:32,410
Perhaps in that case, I'm going to have little staircases here.

1217
01:12:33,190 --> 01:12:33,390
Oh.

1218
01:12:35,590 --> 01:12:35,950
Yo.

1219
01:12:42,410 --> 01:12:43,750
Oh no, that looks horrible.

1220
01:12:45,230 --> 01:12:46,590
Why is it not flush?

1221
01:12:51,950 --> 01:12:52,850
What the hell?

1222
01:12:56,510 --> 01:12:57,390
Oh my god.

1223
01:12:58,230 --> 01:12:58,770
No.

1224
01:13:02,970 --> 01:13:03,510
No!

1225
01:13:05,330 --> 01:13:05,970
Got him.

1226
01:13:06,350 --> 01:13:07,530
Tell me that fire is not spreading.

1227
01:13:14,330 --> 01:13:15,090
Don't do it.

1228
01:13:19,310 --> 01:13:20,110
I'm worried.

1229
01:13:24,250 --> 01:13:25,510
It doesn't look like it is.

1230
01:13:25,650 --> 01:13:25,930
Weird.

1231
01:13:31,490 --> 01:13:32,170
Okay.

1232
01:13:34,550 --> 01:13:39,750
I need to make more normal-ass brick walls.

1233
01:13:40,530 --> 01:13:41,910
That means stonecutter.

1234
01:13:42,110 --> 01:13:43,570
Or not brick walls, the other one.

1235
01:13:45,790 --> 01:13:46,610
This one.

1236
01:13:46,730 --> 01:13:47,410
Cobblestone wall.

1237
01:13:51,490 --> 01:13:53,650
Let's go ahead and feed these guys.

1238
01:13:53,990 --> 01:13:56,370
Yeah, wait.

1239
01:13:58,990 --> 01:14:00,510
I probably don't have enough food yet.

1240
01:14:00,890 --> 01:14:01,230
Has it grown?

1241
01:14:01,790 --> 01:14:02,450
Not really.

1242
01:14:02,550 --> 01:14:03,170
Let's wait a bit more.

1243
01:14:06,090 --> 01:14:07,050
What did I come for?

1244
01:14:07,250 --> 01:14:07,410
Right.

1245
01:14:07,650 --> 01:14:08,050
Stonecutter.

1246
01:14:12,990 --> 01:14:16,950
Give me... Oh wait, I need cobblestone, of course.

1247
01:14:20,750 --> 01:14:21,810
And... this one.

1248
01:14:24,010 --> 01:14:24,670
Cobble me!

1249
01:14:26,550 --> 01:14:27,650
Oh yeah, look at all that.

1250
01:14:28,070 --> 01:14:28,910
We can make so much.

1251
01:14:30,050 --> 01:14:33,630
Actually, material is not really a shortage here when it comes to stone.

1252
01:14:34,410 --> 01:14:35,710
We have so much of it.

1253
01:14:36,730 --> 01:14:37,690
Not even a problem.

1254
01:14:38,750 --> 01:14:39,730
Rick, you're at work!

1255
01:14:39,730 --> 01:14:40,310
I love it!

1256
01:14:41,790 --> 01:14:42,750
Keep doing that.

1257
01:14:43,630 --> 01:14:44,750
Make the village proud.

1258
01:14:46,710 --> 01:14:50,050
Also, I'm still kind of paying attention to whether or not villagers will escape.

1259
01:15:03,670 --> 01:15:05,230
See, something like this is disgusting.

1260
01:15:05,450 --> 01:15:07,530
This almost looks like a piston from a distance, doesn't it?

1261
01:15:10,150 --> 01:15:10,470
Boo.

1262
01:15:12,190 --> 01:15:12,970
No, thank you.

1263
01:15:16,010 --> 01:15:17,450
We gotta add decoration to this wall.

1264
01:15:17,770 --> 01:15:19,210
Ah, this is ugly, this right here.

1265
01:15:19,270 --> 01:15:19,990
This is so ugly.

1266
01:15:25,640 --> 01:15:27,600
I kind of want to break it up with something, you know?

1267
01:15:29,160 --> 01:15:33,080
Like, I thought of the pillars, but there's going to be too many pillars here.

1268
01:15:33,660 --> 01:15:36,640
I can't have a pillar like here, there, there, there, and there.

1269
01:15:37,220 --> 01:15:38,240
It's going to look ridiculous.

1270
01:15:41,100 --> 01:15:47,300
I could just make this drop-off more gradual with... I don't know.

1271
01:15:48,700 --> 01:15:49,940
Let's just do this first.

1272
01:15:53,330 --> 01:15:55,030
Make it safe before we do anything else.

1273
01:16:04,690 --> 01:16:09,010
Then we're gonna have a... Oh, can I actually put a door in the wall like that?

1274
01:16:09,890 --> 01:16:10,790
Is that a thing?

1275
01:16:12,850 --> 01:16:13,970
Oh, no!

1276
01:16:16,220 --> 01:16:17,640
Ah, but it's fine, it's fine, it's fine.

1277
01:16:18,440 --> 01:16:19,700
I know how to fix it.

1278
01:16:19,860 --> 01:16:21,540
I know the exact solution for that.

1279
01:16:21,620 --> 01:16:22,220
It's actually no problem.

1280
01:16:25,900 --> 01:16:27,840
In fact, it's going to look even better with my solution.

1281
01:16:29,060 --> 01:16:29,420
Yeah.

1282
01:16:30,420 --> 01:16:31,160
No need to panic.

1283
01:16:31,440 --> 01:16:31,880
False alarm.

1284
01:16:34,980 --> 01:16:35,700
Don't do that.

1285
01:16:36,400 --> 01:16:40,300
I hate when you make a path, and you didn't mean to make a path.

1286
01:16:42,920 --> 01:16:44,920
Reminds me of my childhood a little bit.

1287
01:16:48,660 --> 01:16:49,940
I used to do that all the time.

1288
01:16:50,520 --> 01:16:51,460
Let's get this one, too.

1289
01:16:58,670 --> 01:16:59,190
Nice.

1290
01:17:02,050 --> 01:17:04,510
Continue that, but not for too much longer.

1291
01:17:05,030 --> 01:17:07,610
I think this is it right here.

1292
01:17:08,070 --> 01:17:10,170
So in that case, let's have some dirt.

1293
01:17:12,590 --> 01:17:13,890
Just eat it all up.

1294
01:17:14,490 --> 01:17:14,990
Nom nom nom nom.

1295
01:17:15,770 --> 01:17:16,670
Nom nom nom nom nom.

1296
01:17:19,450 --> 01:17:23,070
Imagine actually eating dirt with a smile on your face, you know?

1297
01:17:25,610 --> 01:17:26,510
That's disgusting.

1298
01:17:28,270 --> 01:17:29,130
And you know what?

1299
01:17:29,690 --> 01:17:30,490
Kids do that.

1300
01:17:30,770 --> 01:17:31,770
Like little children.

1301
01:17:31,950 --> 01:17:32,610
They eat dirt.

1302
01:17:32,870 --> 01:17:34,410
And they have a smile on their face.

1303
01:17:34,550 --> 01:17:37,750
It's just... Yeah, I don't know, man.

1304
01:17:38,210 --> 01:17:38,750
They're stupid.

1305
01:17:43,070 --> 01:17:43,510
Here.

1306
01:17:44,370 --> 01:17:44,810
Here.

1307
01:17:45,570 --> 01:17:46,410
Get rid of that.

1308
01:17:49,770 --> 01:17:51,330
Please get... Oh wait, I have a shear.

1309
01:17:51,510 --> 01:17:51,870
Yes!

1310
01:17:52,550 --> 01:17:52,930
Ed!

1311
01:17:54,150 --> 01:17:59,150
Oh, I've got to take care of this guy too.

1312
01:18:00,010 --> 01:18:02,470
I forgot how effective the shear is.

1313
01:18:04,610 --> 01:18:05,990
Holy shiiiit.

1314
01:18:07,650 --> 01:18:08,730
I kind of just want to burn it.

1315
01:18:10,630 --> 01:18:15,990
Now, having trees near the wall is actually also risky because the trees do something very specific.

1316
01:18:16,470 --> 01:18:17,190
They grow.

1317
01:18:18,050 --> 01:18:24,970
Which could, you know, unintentionally make it so that someone could walk on these leaves and get inside.

1318
01:18:26,050 --> 01:18:27,870
Or out, for that matter.

1319
01:18:28,210 --> 01:18:29,950
It's like, uh, it goes both ways.

1320
01:18:33,250 --> 01:18:33,790
Good.

1321
01:18:34,530 --> 01:18:36,590
Now we wall it to here.

1322
01:18:37,190 --> 01:18:39,590
And then we dirt it like that.

1323
01:18:41,090 --> 01:18:41,830
Yes, sir.

1324
01:18:42,110 --> 01:18:44,230
In fact, how about we do this instead?

1325
01:18:45,670 --> 01:18:48,290
We're gonna raise the level one more block here.

1326
01:18:59,450 --> 01:19:00,250
Like this.

1327
01:19:06,740 --> 01:19:08,420
We're gonna have a pillar here at the end, of course.

1328
01:19:14,260 --> 01:19:14,620
No!

1329
01:19:15,980 --> 01:19:16,680
Absolutely not.

1330
01:19:19,980 --> 01:19:22,320
This guy goes away, and there.

1331
01:19:24,180 --> 01:19:25,000
Not the worst.

1332
01:19:25,320 --> 01:19:26,920
See, this right here, this is disgusting.

1333
01:19:27,600 --> 01:19:28,740
This is not a thing.

1334
01:19:28,900 --> 01:19:29,880
We need to fill this up.

1335
01:19:30,180 --> 01:19:30,820
For sure.

1336
01:19:31,660 --> 01:19:35,580
We're going to have a path that goes down here with a staircase, all that.

1337
01:19:37,120 --> 01:19:37,860
I like that.

1338
01:19:40,120 --> 01:19:41,520
For now, we're going to put dirt here.

1339
01:19:42,260 --> 01:19:43,580
To be filled later.

1340
01:19:50,520 --> 01:19:51,040
Okay.

1341
01:19:52,020 --> 01:19:53,560
So right now it's definitely ugly.

1342
01:19:53,820 --> 01:19:54,940
We can prettify it.

1343
01:19:56,500 --> 01:19:57,940
Let's start by doing the corners.

1344
01:20:02,780 --> 01:20:04,560
