05:57:41,050 --> 05:57:43,010
I must have put it back in my whatever.

5943
05:57:43,350 --> 05:57:43,450
Yeah.

5944
05:57:45,330 --> 05:57:46,830
Let's just strip them then.

5945
05:57:49,570 --> 05:57:51,770
I'm assuming it's not going to be that good.

5946
05:57:52,830 --> 05:57:53,810
Then I actually...

5947
05:57:55,040 --> 05:57:57,300
Kind of works, I would say.

5948
05:57:58,240 --> 05:57:59,340
It's not the worst.

5949
05:58:06,040 --> 05:58:06,680
Yeah.

5950
05:58:10,330 --> 05:58:12,670
And this stone right here, we can change that, of course.

5951
05:58:13,550 --> 05:58:13,750
You know?

5952
05:58:14,750 --> 05:58:15,730
Oh, watch this.

5953
05:58:15,850 --> 05:58:16,830
Also, I'm going to remove this, by the way.

5954
05:58:16,930 --> 05:58:18,290
Because it's going to be distracting right now.

5955
05:58:19,790 --> 05:58:20,690
I know how to do this.

5956
05:58:22,550 --> 05:58:25,450
We are... Oh, this is such a great transition we can make here.

5957
05:58:31,270 --> 05:58:32,890
We're going to utilize this guy.

5958
05:58:38,460 --> 05:58:39,100
Stop vibrating.

5959
05:58:47,540 --> 05:58:48,800
I don't know, man.

5960
05:58:48,940 --> 05:58:49,660
It's getting weird.

5961
05:58:50,580 --> 05:58:52,200
I feel like I'm overthinking this a little.

5962
05:58:52,680 --> 05:58:54,280
I kind of just want to go back to that.

5963
05:58:54,340 --> 05:58:54,820
Is that crazy?

5964
05:59:02,480 --> 05:59:04,340
Honestly, that looks better now.

5965
05:59:05,300 --> 05:59:06,780
Am I losing my mind?

5966
05:59:09,960 --> 05:59:11,480
I feel like that's really good.

5967
05:59:16,720 --> 05:59:18,400
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

5968
05:59:25,760 --> 05:59:26,920
Like, I don't even know...

5969
05:59:33,160 --> 05:59:34,540
Don't even know what I'm looking at.

5970
05:59:36,900 --> 05:59:38,240
You're suffering out there, huh?

5971
05:59:38,520 --> 05:59:39,980
You can't get through my wall!

5972
05:59:42,140 --> 05:59:43,420
Look at my beautiful wall.

5973
05:59:44,660 --> 05:59:45,460
So nice.

5974
05:59:51,300 --> 05:59:55,380
Maybe at the front here, I'll have some kind of, um... Hmm.

5975
05:59:57,460 --> 05:59:59,540
Maybe something sort of sticks out this way.

5976
06:00:02,550 --> 06:00:06,010
Oh, maybe there's going to be a little something-something here.

5977
06:00:10,270 --> 06:00:14,830
Similar to the second house in my first time I played Minecraft.

5978
06:00:15,330 --> 06:00:20,910
Remember, I had this little outdoor area underneath with, like, smithy stuff and all that?

5979
06:00:21,770 --> 06:00:23,210
Maybe that can happen here.

5980
06:00:23,950 --> 06:00:26,750
But something like a flower garden instead.

5981
06:00:30,380 --> 06:00:31,740
Obviously, we gotta fix this wall, too.

5982
06:00:34,700 --> 06:00:36,380
Can you actually go up there?

5983
06:00:36,860 --> 06:00:37,880
They'll go up those things.

5984
06:00:39,900 --> 06:00:40,920
Okay, it doesn't look like it.

5985
06:00:42,160 --> 06:00:46,520
By the way, so far, it looks like... Why are the cows so obsessed with that up there?

5986
06:00:47,480 --> 06:00:48,340
What's happening here?

5987
06:00:53,140 --> 06:00:54,180
What's happening here?

5988
06:00:59,280 --> 06:01:00,820
Man, they're trying to escape.

5989
06:01:01,020 --> 06:01:01,140
Look!

5990
06:01:02,680 --> 06:01:04,020
It ain't happening, bros.

5991
06:01:04,820 --> 06:01:05,060
No.

5992
06:01:06,220 --> 06:01:07,060
No, no, no.

5993
06:01:07,860 --> 06:01:08,680
You're staying here.

5994
06:01:08,800 --> 06:01:10,780
They're willing to kill themselves for the escape.

5995
06:01:11,520 --> 06:01:13,240
That's how bad their life is here.

5996
06:01:14,880 --> 06:01:15,780
Ungrateful cows.

5997
06:01:17,360 --> 06:01:17,820
Unbelievable.

5998
06:01:18,120 --> 06:01:18,600
Hey, Rick.

5999
06:01:19,680 --> 06:01:20,900
Everyone is safe here, right?

6000
06:01:21,400 --> 06:01:24,800
So we haven't had any issues with the village in all this time, by the way.

6001
06:01:25,260 --> 06:01:25,720
Noticed?

6002
06:01:27,340 --> 06:01:29,520
Okay, guys, it's time to check the Orphan Crusher.

6003
06:01:30,440 --> 06:01:31,320
What do we think?

6004
06:01:31,920 --> 06:01:35,220
I'm gonna say... 15.

6005
06:01:35,680 --> 06:01:36,600
No, 20.

6006
06:01:38,480 --> 06:01:38,960
Boom.

6007
06:01:40,320 --> 06:01:41,120
No, 15.

6008
06:01:49,110 --> 06:01:49,550
GUYS!

6009
06:01:50,790 --> 06:01:51,710
It's working!

6010
06:01:53,250 --> 06:01:54,890
Holy crap, look at all that!

6011
06:01:57,110 --> 06:02:01,890
I'm putting you straight back, because I don't have space in my inventory, but that is fantastic!

6012
06:02:02,790 --> 06:02:06,750
Look at the orphan crud- You know what, let's just take a trip up there and listen.

6013
06:02:06,930 --> 06:02:09,890
I just wanna hear what's going on inside!

6014
06:02:11,050 --> 06:02:11,970
Get away from me.

6015
06:02:17,260 --> 06:02:18,140
Are you ready?

6016
06:02:19,540 --> 06:02:21,040
Get ready for the suffering.

6017
06:02:28,040 --> 06:02:29,380
I can hear them inside.

6018
06:02:34,020 --> 06:02:34,660
Yeah.

6019
06:02:36,040 --> 06:02:37,140
There it goes.

6020
06:02:38,300 --> 06:02:40,260
Honestly, it's working really well.

6021
06:02:45,150 --> 06:02:45,790
Fuck yeah.

6022
06:02:47,590 --> 06:02:49,110
Oh, look at this right here.

6023
06:02:49,390 --> 06:02:49,930
The greenery.

6024
06:02:50,510 --> 06:02:51,930
Ah, I didn't mean to destroy that, actually.

6025
06:02:53,470 --> 06:02:55,950
I want to put greenery around my houses more.

6026
06:02:56,110 --> 06:02:59,450
Because I think that is another way to, you know, ground them in the world.

6027
06:03:00,010 --> 06:03:00,950
A little bit more.

6028
06:03:03,890 --> 06:03:06,230
What is happening with... Okay, are you seeing this?

6029
06:03:09,310 --> 06:03:10,390
Look at the shadow on that.

6030
06:03:10,530 --> 06:03:11,910
It looks like a different color entirely.

6031
06:03:15,040 --> 06:03:17,160
Also, it totally looks Japanese now.

6032
06:03:17,460 --> 06:03:20,700
Because of that... angle I put it.

6033
06:03:20,900 --> 06:03:26,860
Or I gave it... Is it because of... I don't know what's happening there.

6034
06:03:28,080 --> 06:03:29,940
That is a damn mystery.

6035
06:03:31,880 --> 06:03:34,040
What is happening up there?

6036
06:03:34,860 --> 06:03:36,820
Is it the lighting that's messing up?

6037
06:03:38,260 --> 06:03:42,860
If I do this... Is that...

6038
06:03:46,460 --> 06:03:48,120
It's messing with my eyes.

6039
06:03:49,580 --> 06:03:50,700
I can't get over that.

6040
06:03:51,200 --> 06:03:53,860
Also, this house did not look very good from up there, I gotta be honest.

6041
06:03:54,080 --> 06:03:57,080
This wall right here definitely needs something else, something more.

6042
06:03:58,480 --> 06:04:05,140
And I'm thinking maybe we do like an extension here that leads down into Rick's area here.

6043
06:04:05,640 --> 06:04:07,960
So you have a way of going up this way as well.

6044
06:04:09,060 --> 06:04:10,180
Wouldn't that be kind of cool?

6045
06:04:13,820 --> 06:04:19,860
Or maybe... Oh, maybe we connect this piece right here with the upstairs here.

6046
06:04:20,220 --> 06:04:21,420
Like a kind of bridge.

6047
06:04:21,900 --> 06:04:25,360
But the bridge is like those from Elden Ring, you know?

6048
06:04:26,000 --> 06:04:29,360
Imagine... Rhea Lucaria, if you've played the game, of course.

6049
06:04:30,300 --> 06:04:32,020
There's these, like, walkways, I guess.

6050
06:04:32,580 --> 06:04:33,540
Harry Potter-esque.

6051
06:04:34,980 --> 06:04:36,440
Something like... I don't know, maybe not.

6052
06:04:36,600 --> 06:04:37,360
I'll have to think on that.

6053
06:04:38,560 --> 06:04:39,640
Something like that, at least.

6054
06:04:41,060 --> 06:04:43,620
Anyway, guys, that's it for me now.

6055
06:04:54,340 --> 06:04:55,080
There we go.

6056
06:04:59,500 --> 06:05:05,040
I think I laid the foundation quite well for what's to come.

6057
06:05:05,900 --> 06:05:09,520
You know, I expanded the village with the walls.

6058
06:05:11,500 --> 06:05:13,760
I put down the foundation for greatness.

6059
06:05:17,440 --> 06:05:18,680
Library looks great so far.

6060
06:05:18,740 --> 06:05:19,600
How did you know it was a library?

6061
06:05:21,440 --> 06:05:22,280
Did I give it away?

6062
06:05:23,040 --> 06:05:24,720
It was supposed to be a bit of a surprise.

6063
06:05:29,030 --> 06:05:29,610
I said it?

6064
06:05:29,730 --> 06:05:30,210
Oh, I said it?

6065
06:05:30,770 --> 06:05:31,570
Okay, never mind.

6066
06:05:33,710 --> 06:05:34,470
Ah, damn it.

6067
06:05:36,070 --> 06:05:37,170
Yeah, it's gonna be a library.

6068
06:05:39,030 --> 06:05:40,270
Oh, I guess I did tell you.

6069
06:05:41,210 --> 06:05:41,490
Yeah.

6070
06:05:43,710 --> 06:05:45,790
Nice work making Smashburgers with the mace.

6071
06:05:45,910 --> 06:05:46,370
Thank you!

6072
06:05:48,410 --> 06:05:49,050
Me smash.

6073
06:05:50,350 --> 06:05:50,890
Notice me?

6074
06:05:51,030 --> 06:05:52,690
Hey, what's up, the Yanko Minecraft cape?

6075
06:05:53,550 --> 06:05:54,810
Weird name, what does that even mean?

6076
06:05:59,310 --> 06:06:00,870
Telepathy works both ways.

6077
06:06:01,230 --> 06:06:01,650
Yeah.

6078
06:06:04,130 --> 06:06:05,710
You almost lost your mind there.

6079
06:06:05,790 --> 06:06:07,190
I did, but it was honestly fun.

6080
06:06:07,950 --> 06:06:13,650
I'm also so frustrated with myself that I can't fucking copy what I just did before.

6081
06:06:13,870 --> 06:06:17,330
It's just not intuitive for me at all, the building, sometimes.

6082
06:06:20,290 --> 06:06:21,090
That's on me.

6083
06:06:28,230 --> 06:06:29,170
It's okay, it's universal.

6084
06:06:29,210 --> 06:06:30,110
I don't know about that.

6085
06:06:30,230 --> 06:06:32,170
I feel like I have a special problem with that.

6086
06:06:35,980 --> 06:06:38,920
Slaps are just... so annoying.

6087
06:06:40,420 --> 06:06:42,100
It was like watching Clone.

6088
06:06:45,640 --> 06:06:46,760
Who was I?

6089
06:06:46,860 --> 06:06:49,780
Frank or... Who's the other guy?

6090
06:06:50,140 --> 06:06:53,440
Frank... oh... I forget his name.

6091
06:06:55,820 --> 06:06:56,540
Casper?

6092
06:07:02,920 --> 06:07:07,920
I don't think I would have learned to build without looking at what others do, so I think you're doing good.

6093
06:07:08,040 --> 06:07:10,420
Well, I also looked at what other villages did in the game, right?

6094
06:07:11,720 --> 06:07:14,940
My whole village is basically a copy of another village I found in the world.

6095
06:07:16,940 --> 06:07:18,800
Trust me, I'm also lagging imagination.

6096
06:07:19,160 --> 06:07:21,560
It's taking a while to try to make something new.

6097
06:07:33,510 --> 06:07:34,830
That's how we all start, don't worry.

6098
06:07:34,990 --> 06:07:35,690
Okay, thank god.

6099
06:07:36,690 --> 06:07:44,730
I definitely want to acquire more... I want to be able to look at something and immediately know what would be a good thing to use there, you know?

6100
06:07:44,830 --> 06:07:49,330
Like, what kind of block or... what kind of shape would be nice to have there.

6101
06:07:50,150 --> 06:07:51,230
Stuff like that, right?

6102
06:07:52,390 --> 06:07:56,050
I know you can create amazing things that look amazing in this game.

6103
06:07:56,790 --> 06:08:01,610
That's why I keep experimenting with different stuff, because I know there's ways to make things look cool.

6104
06:08:05,120 --> 06:08:05,840
Is it over?

6105
06:08:05,980 --> 06:08:06,120
Yeah.

6106
06:08:07,240 --> 06:08:08,360
It's been six hours now.

6107
06:08:13,780 --> 06:08:15,560
Maybe try something more modern sometime.

6108
06:08:15,760 --> 06:08:16,340
Just a suggestion.

6109
06:08:16,680 --> 06:08:19,180
I tried doing that in the first world I had.

6110
06:08:19,620 --> 06:08:20,580
With my second house.

6111
06:08:20,720 --> 06:08:22,740
I feel like that was a bit of a modern house, wasn't it?

6112
06:08:24,660 --> 06:08:25,620
And that was kind of cool.

6113
06:08:25,740 --> 06:08:27,780
I think I did better with that than I did with this.

6114
06:08:30,120 --> 06:08:32,100
Like, I was better at doing the modern house.

6115
06:08:43,680 --> 06:08:46,280
I often dream about Minecraft after playing.

6116
06:08:46,500 --> 06:08:48,400
Do you dream of mining or building ever?

6117
06:08:48,760 --> 06:08:49,760
I don't know.

6118
06:08:50,100 --> 06:08:52,260
I very rarely remember my dreams.

6119
06:08:53,200 --> 06:08:54,220
But it's possible.

6120
06:08:54,420 --> 06:08:56,020
I usually dream about games I play.

6121
06:09:01,480 --> 06:09:02,280
Great music?

6122
06:09:02,440 --> 06:09:02,880
Yeah, man.

6123
06:09:02,980 --> 06:09:04,040
Minecraft has great music.

6124
06:09:05,140 --> 06:09:06,360
So many bangers.

6125
06:09:14,860 --> 06:09:16,560
Do the slaps still slap?

6126
06:09:17,800 --> 06:09:18,900
I gotta be honest.

6127
06:09:19,080 --> 06:09:19,680
I don't think so.

6128
06:09:20,260 --> 06:09:22,240
I'm closing down the only slaps page.

6129
06:09:23,780 --> 06:09:25,320
It's not gonna happen, guys.

6130
06:09:25,440 --> 06:09:25,740
I'm sorry.

6131
06:09:29,000 --> 06:09:30,780
Do you have a schedule for when you stream?

6132
06:09:31,180 --> 06:09:32,500
I don't, actually.

6133
06:09:33,180 --> 06:09:34,900
It's mostly just whenever I feel like it.

6134
06:09:34,980 --> 06:09:39,120
But I do try to put up a reminder on the Discord.

6135
06:09:39,760 --> 06:09:41,620
Like a day or maybe two days beforehand.

6136
06:09:42,300 --> 06:09:42,680
Mostly.

6137
06:09:43,580 --> 06:09:45,980
Sometimes I just put on the stream when I feel like it.

6138
06:09:49,380 --> 06:09:52,560
Who knows, maybe that will change in the future and I'll have a schedule of some sort.

6139
06:09:56,230 --> 06:10:01,450
Because it could be cool to just have a schedule and go live at a specified time and not know what to do.

6140
06:10:02,190 --> 06:10:03,350
You know, I go live.

6141
06:10:04,190 --> 06:10:05,670
I just sit and chat with you guys.

6142
06:10:05,890 --> 06:10:09,770
And then maybe I feel like playing something and I start playing it.

6143
06:10:10,050 --> 06:10:11,990
It could be Minecraft or Elden Ring.

6144
06:10:12,190 --> 06:10:13,570
Well, in this case, those two games, right?

6145
06:10:14,190 --> 06:10:16,510
But any other game or maybe something completely different.

6146
06:10:18,170 --> 06:10:20,950
I've been wanting to play StarCraft again recently.

6147
06:10:22,350 --> 06:10:24,930
Microsoft Flight Simulator, I've been wanting to just...

6148
06:10:26,360 --> 06:10:27,900
Play and hang back with, you know?

6149
06:10:28,020 --> 06:10:30,360
And those types of games where I can also talk to you guys.

6150
06:10:31,660 --> 06:10:33,380
Because I know them by heart, pretty much.

6151
06:10:34,760 --> 06:10:38,220
It's muscle memory, so... I can still... I can talk and play.

6152
06:10:41,720 --> 06:10:46,360
Or something like Kerbal Space Program, or... Factorio, you know?

6153
06:10:46,720 --> 06:10:47,680
Games like that.

6154
06:10:52,980 --> 06:10:53,860
Maybe even chess.

6155
06:10:54,080 --> 06:10:55,740
I was thinking about playing some chess on stream.

6156
06:10:56,300 --> 06:10:57,840
I am so bad at it, though.

6157
06:10:58,260 --> 06:11:00,700
But that's okay, because I think maybe you guys could help me.

6158
06:11:01,280 --> 06:11:03,100
There's probably some of you who are really good at it.

6159
06:11:03,620 --> 06:11:04,100
You know?

6160
06:11:05,740 --> 06:11:08,200
And I'm not saying, like, you give me the best move.

6161
06:11:08,860 --> 06:11:12,380
Listen, I'm not... We're not gonna do a Dr. Lupo impression here, okay?

6162
06:11:13,140 --> 06:11:18,520
All I'm saying is... You can give me, like, general pointers of what to do in a game.

6163
06:11:19,700 --> 06:11:22,100
I don't know if any of you know what I'm talking about there, by the way.

6164
06:11:28,400 --> 06:11:30,180
Do you guys know about ChessBraw?

6165
06:11:30,720 --> 06:11:31,720
The YouTube channel?

6166
06:11:32,040 --> 06:11:45,780
They just released a video called the Dr. Lupo challenge, where a Grandmaster, his name is Aman, he tries to do the same thing, where he loses his queen, and then he tries to go for 26 perfect moves, like perfect engine moves.

6167
06:11:46,200 --> 06:11:48,920
And it's so difficult even for a Grandmaster to do.

6168
06:11:49,840 --> 06:11:50,820
It's insanity.

6169
06:11:51,960 --> 06:11:53,540
I love the Dr. Lupo drama.

6170
06:11:53,700 --> 06:11:54,220
Yeah, me too!

6171
06:11:54,440 --> 06:11:56,280
I've been having a blast with that.

6172
06:11:56,840 --> 06:12:02,060
I also watched the Eric video where he talked about the... the Dr. Lupo stuff.

6173
06:12:11,520 --> 06:12:13,260
GTA 6 trailer 2 reaction?

6174
06:12:14,620 --> 06:12:16,220
Yeah, maybe we can do that next time, yeah.

6175
06:12:18,420 --> 06:12:19,360
Not a bad idea.

6176
06:12:24,220 --> 06:12:26,060
Oliver, did you ever watch the Minecraft movie?

6177
06:12:26,140 --> 06:12:27,960
No, I'm waiting for it to come out on VHS.

6178
06:12:29,580 --> 06:12:32,760
I'm gonna pop that bad boy in and hit play.

6179
06:12:35,200 --> 06:12:36,900
But I'm probably gonna watch it with a friend.

6180
06:12:39,060 --> 06:12:40,200
Yeah, on VHS.

6181
06:12:40,920 --> 06:12:41,680
Or DVD.

6182
06:12:44,800 --> 06:12:46,660
Will you watch the Papers, Please short film?

6183
06:12:47,460 --> 06:12:49,560
I guess so.

6184
06:12:50,940 --> 06:12:51,380
Yeah.

6185
06:12:56,660 --> 06:12:58,460
It'll release digital next week?

6186
06:12:58,660 --> 06:12:58,900
Okay.

6187
06:12:59,640 --> 06:13:01,160
I have such a problem saying digital.

6188
06:13:01,920 --> 06:13:05,160
I nailed it there, actually, but usually digital, digital, digital.

6189
06:13:05,400 --> 06:13:06,980
That is such a difficult word.

6190
06:13:15,480 --> 06:13:20,900
I've definitely been thinking about playing something like maybe Total War.

6191
06:13:22,560 --> 06:13:28,540
When I was talking about it the other day during the tier list, I just... I was reminded how much I love those games.

6192
06:13:29,280 --> 06:13:33,860
I think it could be a really fun game to play and just hang back and talk to chat with at the same time.

6193
06:13:35,900 --> 06:13:36,500
You know?

